-- The cells the corpus marks illegible: the corner cell under the page's
-- screen (seniority 1, grade 1) of א'5, ב'5, ג'5 and ד'6, and א'6 at
-- seniority 18, grade 1. No rule here reads them.
`why the annexes' illegible cells of 30.9.2016 are not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "נספחים א'5, ב'5, ג'5 ו־ד'6: התא של ותק 1 בדרגה 1; נספח א'6: התא של ותק 18 בדרגה 1 — לא קריא"

-- §5(א)'s table cell: annex א'k at a seniority and grade (k from 1 to 7).
GIVEN annex IS A NUMBER, seniority IS A NUMBER, `the grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cell of the September 2016 annexes א'1–א'7` annex seniority `the grade` IS
    IF annex LESS THAN 1 THEN NOTHING
    ELSE CONSIDER drop (annex MINUS 1) `annexes א' of 30.9.2016`
         WHEN t FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `the published cell at` t seniority `the grade`
         WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING

§§ `נספח ה' — המקדם X`

-- Annex ה' (p. 60), §10(א)(2)'s coefficient X: for each last month as an
-- active employee ("חודש אחרון כפעיל"), from 1.2013 to 9.2019, X under six
-- windows of payment, from 1.9.2016 to 28.2.2017, 1.3.2017 to 31.5.2018,
-- 1.6.2018 to 30.11.2018, 1.12.2018 to 28.2.2019, 1.3.2019 to 30.9.2019
-- and from 1.10.2019 on; a cell is blank where the window began before the
-- month did. DATA, as the corpus publishes it. The agreement of 19.3.2017
-- replaces this annex with its own annex א' (imported there).
@desc A row of annex ה' of the September 2016 agreement: a last month as an active employee and X in each window of payment.
DECLARE `annex ה' row of 30.9.2016` HAS
    `the last active year of annex ה'`  IS A NUMBER
    `the last active month of annex ה'` IS A NUMBER
    `X in each window of annex ה'`      IS A LIST OF MAYBE NUMBER

